# The ratchet's own prose heuristics.
#
# The six subjects in config.json are checks of the checker: each reproduces a
# defect this repository actually shipped, and each needs arbitrary computation
# (scratch corpora, merge simulation, PNG round-trips), so they stay scripts.
#
# This one is the other half of the argument -- a standing invariant that needs
# no plumbing at all, and so is written as data instead of as code. If the prose
# form cannot express the invariants of the tool that ships it, it cannot be
# claimed to express anyone else's.

heuristic test-suite
  run      node --test ratchet/dist/test/
  timeout  600000
  applies  when ratchet/dist/test exists
  measure  failing  number after "# fail"
  measure  passing  number after "# pass"
  rule     failing is 0
  rule     passing is at least 148
  because  a suite that shrinks silently is how a ratchet stops ratcheting: the
  because  count is a floor, raised deliberately, never lowered by accident
